OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle 'significant
OL,4,Awildfire' near bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are dealing with a
OL,7,F"significant wildfire" in a field near
OL,8,Fthe Tamar Bridge.
OL,10,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService said the fire had been reported
OL,12,Fin a field near the bridge at 09:42 BST
OL,13,Fand eight fire engines had been sent to
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FTamar Crossings, which operates the
OL,17,Fbridge, advised drivers to take extra
OL,18,Fcare and said it was monitoring
OL,19,Fvisibility levels due to the smoke from
OL,20,Fthe "significant" fire to ensure
OL,21,Fcrossings remained safe for drivers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
